def target : ℕ := 0x2004000008010000020040000080100000200400000801000002004000008010000020040000080100000200600000002800004002000010008000040020000100080000400200001000800004002000010008000040020000140040080500100a0040040280100100a0040040280100100a0040040280100100a0040040280100100a00600402
def posted : Fin 33 → Fin 33 → Bool := fun a b => decide (∃ i : Fin 11, ((a.val = i.val ∨ a.val = 11 + i.val) ∧ (b.val = (i.val+1)%11 ∨ b.val = 22+i.val)) ∨ ((b.val = i.val ∨ b.val = 11+i.val) ∧ (a.val = (i.val+1)%11 ∨ a.val = 22+i.val)))

theorem starts : ∀ a b : Fin 33,sample seed (33*a.val+b.val)=oneEach a b := by decide +kernel
theorem matchesTable : ∀ a b : Fin 33,target.testBit (33*a.val+b.val)=posted a b := by decide +kernel
theorem finishes : (ops.foldl numStep seed).getD 141 0=target := by decide +kernel

theorem upper : RepSizeAtMost posted 76 := by
  refine ⟨C,?_,by decide,?_⟩
  · intro g hg
    change g ∈ ops.map mk at hg
    obtain ⟨t,_,rfl⟩ := List.mem_map.mp hg
    rcases t with ⟨b,a,c⟩
    cases b <;> simp [mk]
  · intro a b
    rw [← starts a b]
    change ((ops.map mk).foldl boolStep (sample seed (33*a.val+b.val))).getD 141 false=posted a b
    rw [run,getSample,finishes,matchesTable]

end Cycle11Upper
